This license covers original Landfall code. Third-party material keeps its own
license: the Landfall identity assets and tokens (design/, web/public/), Google
Fonts (SIL Open Font License), and npm/PyPI dependencies under their licenses.

Packaged reference data and map geometry:
- landfall/data/gazetteer.tsv (gazetteer@1) and the country names in
  landfall/data/countries.json are derived from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org),
  licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: a subset of cities15000
  (name, ASCII name, admin1 name, country, lat, lon, population), coordinates rounded
  to 4 decimals; country names plus a short alias list added by Landfall.
- The world map uses world-atlas 2.0.2 (ISC, Copyright 2013-2019 Michael Bostock),
  built from Natural Earth data (public domain), drawn with d3-geo and
  topojson-client (ISC).
